  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1902.01 Hearings. Hearings shall be conducted by hearings examiners within the bureau of hearings of the department, and governed by the provisions of Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. #4823, eff 6-1-90; ss by #4981, eff 11-16-90; ss by #6293, eff 7-23-96; ss by #7884, eff 4-20-03; ss by #8339, eff 4-26-05 (from Saf-C 1903.01); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22\n\nNew. 13614, eff 4-25-23",
